message: "If you use this prototype, please cite the repository and the underlying data sources."
title: "FRESH Urban Forest Lab"
abstract: "An open, reproducible urban-forest modelling and decision-support lab. It links public LiDAR, tree inventories, and individual-tree growth models to a 2D and 3D editing front end so planners can measure canopy structure and test management scenarios."
authors:
  - name: "UBC FRESH Lab"
repository-code: "https://github.com/UBC-FRESH/fresh-urban-forest-lab"
